(2011, '&#39;함께하는 고향사랑&#39; 평창군 고향사랑기부제 답례품 후기 챌린지', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src="https://ilovegohyang.go.kr/upload/editor/20241120/7de987d5-ab09-496f-b1c0-799e5801cae60/editor.jpg" alt=""></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p class="0"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">&lt;</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">평창군 고향사랑기부제 답례품 후기 챌린지</span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">&gt;</span></p><p class="0"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">📌 </span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">이벤트명</span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">: ‘</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">함께하는 고향사랑</span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">’ </span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">평창군 고향사랑기부제 답례품 후기 챌린지</span></p><p class="0" style="margin-left:68.3pt;text-indent:-68.3pt;text-autospace:none;"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">📌 </span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">내    용</span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">: 2024. 11. 20.(</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">수</span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">) ~ 12. 3.(</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">화</span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">) 14</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">일간 고향사랑</span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">e</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">음 홈페이지에 답례품 후기를 작성 하신 선착순 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">100</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">명에게 평창사랑상품권</span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">(1</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">만원권</span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">) </span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">증정</span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">!</span></p><p class="0" style="margin-left:68.3pt;text-indent:-68.3pt;text-autospace:none;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 24pt;"></span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;※ </span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">SMS </span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">수신 동의자에 한함</span></p><p class="0"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">📌 </span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">발    표</span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">: 2024. 12. 5.(</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">목</span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">) </span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">개별연락 후 상품권 등기 발송</span></p><p class="0"><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">📌 </span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">경    품</span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">: </span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">평창사랑상품권 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 24pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 24pt;">만원권</span></p><div id="hwpEditorBoardContent" class="hwp_editor_board_content" data-hjsonver="1.0" data-jsonlen="7546"><!--[data-hwpjson]{
