(2013, '의米(미)있는 고향사랑기부', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p style="color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: ''Noto Sans KR'', NotoSansKR-Regular, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; white-space-collapse: preserve; line-height: 19.2px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 12pt;">우리의 소중한 고향인 전북특별자치도</span></p><p style="color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: ''Noto Sans KR'', NotoSansKR-Regular, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; white-space-collapse: preserve; line-height: 19.2px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 12pt;">이곳에서 땀 흘리며 <span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;">쌀을 재배하는 농업인들이 쌀소비량 감소</span>와</span></p><p style="color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: ''Noto Sans KR'', NotoSansKR-Regular, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; white-space-collapse: preserve; line-height: 19.2px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;">떨어지는 쌀값으로 인해 어려움</span>을 겪고 있습니다.</span></p><p style="color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: ''Noto Sans KR'', NotoSansKR-Regular, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; white-space-collapse: preserve; line-height: 19.2px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 12pt;"> </span></p><p style="color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: ''Noto Sans KR'', NotoSansKR-Regular, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; white-space-collapse: preserve; line-height: 19.2px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px;">의米(미)있는 고향사랑기부에 동참하여 따뜻한 마음을 전해보세요.</span></p><p style="color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: ''Noto Sans KR'', NotoSansKR-Regular, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; white-space-collapse: preserve; line-height: 19.2px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px;"> </span></p><p style="color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: ''Noto Sans KR'', NotoSansKR-Regular, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; white-space-collapse: preserve; line-height: 19.2px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14pt;">○ 추진기간 : ~ 2024. 12. 31.(화)까지</span></p><p style="color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: ''Noto Sans KR'', NotoSansKR-Regular, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; white-space-collapse: preserve; line-height: 19.2px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14pt;">○ 참여방법 : 전북특별자치도(도청, 14개 시군)에 고향사랑기부 + 답례품으로 쌀 선택하기</span> </span></p><p style="color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: ''Noto Sans KR'', NotoSansKR-Regular, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; white-space-collapse: preserve; line-height: 19.2px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14pt;">○ 참여혜택 : 세액공제 + 기부의 기쁨 + 농업인 응원 = 내고향 지키기</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src="https://ilovegohyang.go.kr/upload/editor/20241104/221d078d-0180-4bc2-b4e8-c0ec225334150/editor.jpg" alt=""></p><p><img src="https://ilovegohyang.go.kr/upload/editor/20241104/221d078d-0180-4bc2-b4e8-c0ec225334151/editor.jpg" alt=""></p><br><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'GENERAL', '20241104100000', 'Y', 432, 'Y')
