(3006, '[광주 동구] 역대 최대 혜택 네이버페이 2만원 증정! 고향사랑기부 이벤트', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-size-adjust: none; font-family: ''Pretendard GOV''; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(0, 176, 162); font-family: 나눔고딕코딩, NanumGothicCoding, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; font-family: inherit; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: inherit; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: inherit;"> &lt;</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; font-family: inherit; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; font-family: inherit; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: inherit; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: inherit; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">광주 동구 고향사랑기부 역대 최대 혜택 네이버페이 2만원 증정!!</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; font-family: inherit; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: inherit; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: inherit;">&gt; </span></span></p><p style="text-size-adjust: none; font-family: ''Pretendard GOV''; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</p><p style="text-size-adjust: none; font-family: ''Pretendard GOV''; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; font-family: 나눔고딕코딩, NanumGothicCoding, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: inherit; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: inherit; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">○ 참여기간 : <span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; font-family: inherit; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: inherit; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: inherit;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;"