4,="" 34);"="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; font-family: 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">- 제품에는 소비기한이 표시되며, 소비기한은 제조일로부터 6개월입니다.</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><span helvetica="" neue",="" helvetica,="" arial,="" sans-serif,="" "apple="" color="" emoji",="" "segoe="" ui="" notocoloremoji,="" symbol",="" "android="" emojisymbols;="" line-height:="" 1.5;="" font-size:="" 10pt;="" white-space:="" pre-wrap;="" color:="" rgb(34,="" 34,="" 34);"="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-size-adjust: none; font-family: 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">- 문의처 : 구미시 고향사랑기부팀 (☎️ 054-480-6927)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><br><p>&nbsp;</p>', '3010.png', '', '20260801', '20260930', NULL, NULL, '', '054-480-6927', 'Y', NULL, NULL),
