(3032, '인기 답례품 증량 이벤트', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><b>경남 고성군에서 인기 많은 답례품을 선정해 추가<span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"> 증량 이벤트</span></span>를 실시합니다.</b></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);"><b>경남 고성군에 고향사랑기부</b></span><b>하시고 더 푸짐한 답례품 받아가세요!</b></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><b>기간: </b><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 18pt;"><b><u>2026. 8. 1. ~ 8. 3<span style="font-size: 18pt;">﻿</span>1.</u></b></span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><b>참여방법: 경남 고성군에 <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 18pt;">10만원 이상 </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 18pt;">﻿</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 18pt;">기부</span></span>하고 증량 제공 이벤트 답례품 선택</b></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><b>기부방법: <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">고향사랑e음 또는 웰로(Wello) 플랫폼</span>을 통해 경남 고성군에 기부&nbsp;</b></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '3032.jpg', '', '20260801', '20260831', '48820', '48000', '경남 고성군 인구청년추진단 ', '055-670-2773', 'Y', '고성군', '경상남도'),
(3033, '★[여름맞이 이벤트]★ 리뷰작성 시 네이버페이 5,000P + 추가 답례품 3만원!!', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align: center; " align="center"><img src="https://ilovegohyang.go.kr/upload/editor/20260813/67ae1058-939c-4978-95bf-c2afdbc9a63c0/editor.png" alt=""></p><div style="text-align: center;"><br></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '3033.png', 'https://ilovegohyang.go.kr/goods/searchGoods-main.html?type=L&locgov=44230', '20260803', '20260930', '44230', '44000', '논산시', '041-746-6583', 'Y', '논산시', '충청남도'),
(3034, '[강원 고성]고성사랑상품권 및 고성사랑카드 1만원 추가 지급 이벤트', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 24pt;">▶</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 24pt;">상세안내</span></p><p class="0"><span style="font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;color:#0075c8;">바다가 좋다</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;color:#0075c8;">~</span><span style="font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0pt;color:#0075c8;">고성이 참 좋다</span></p><p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 18pt;">강원 고성군</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">''</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">고성사랑상품권 및 카드</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">만원 추가 지급 이벤트</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">''</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 18pt;">안내</span></p><p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 18pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">기 간</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">: 2026. 5. 6.(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">수</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">) ~ 8. 31.(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">월</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">)</span></p><p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">대 상</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">:&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgb(119, 176, 43); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">10</span></span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; background-color: rgb(119, 176, 43); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">만원 이상 기부</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">+</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="background-color: rgb(119, 176, 43); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">답례품으</span><span style="background-color: rgb(119, 176, 43); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">﻿</span><span style="background-color: rgb(119, 176, 43); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">로 고성사랑상품권</span> 및 <span style="background-color: rgb(119, 176, 43); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">고성사랑카드를 선택한 자</span></span></p><p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">혜 택</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">: 1</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">만원 추가 지급</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">기존 </span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">만원</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">→</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">4</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">만원</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;">)</span></p><p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-we